# 第18章 四套 Commentary 全文閱讀回執

## raw_data/ccbiblestudy_CT_joshua_18.txt
- 行數：267
- 引句：『三個人』很可能是指其餘七個支派(參2節)，故總共21人
- 引句：『冊子』當時尚無紙張，是寫在「羊皮卷」上
- 引句：『基列』不同於約但河東的基列(參書十三25，31)，確實地點不詳，應在便雅憫地業之內

## raw_data/ccbiblestudy_GT_joshua_18.txt
- 行數：322
- 引句：示羅被指認為克貝塞倫（Khirbet Seilu^n）
- 引句：古代近東瓜分父親遺產的慣例，是長子先挑選自己的分，其他繼承人則拈鬮分配
- 引句：「基列」：此字七十士譯本作「基列耶琳」

## raw_data/kingcomments_joshua_18.txt
- 行數：69
- 引句：Now the tent of meeting is set up at Shiloh, which means ‘peace’.
- 引句：Joshua has no successor, but the priest Eleazar does.
- 引句：The city where the temple will be built is in Benjamin.

## raw_data/biblehub_study_joshua_18.txt
- 行數：948
- 引句：Beth-aven, meaning “house of wickedness,” lay near Bethel, a significant religious site, a place later linked with idolatry and spiritual unfaithfulness (Hosea 4:15).
- 引句：Ophrah was a Benjaminite town and should not be confused with Gideon’s Ophrah in Manasseh.
- 引句：Zelah lay in Benjamin and became associated with the burial of Saul and Jonathan in the tomb of Kish, Saul’s father (2 Samuel 21:14).

