## 來源依據
- ccbiblestudy CT: 「米斯巴」就是瞭望樓的意思，表示要神在他們二人中間施行鑒察
- ccbiblestudy GT: 「米斯巴」意為「守望塔」，也有「鑒察」涵義
- KingComments: Mizpah, "watchtower", the boundary drawn which they will not cross
- BibleHub Study: Mizpah, for he said, "May the LORD watch between you and me"
